sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Studente
    participant TUI as CLI/TUI
    participant Runner as student_lab_runner.py
    participant Docker as Sandbox Docker
    participant Reports as Report locale JSON
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard docente

    S->>TUI: sceglie consegna e scrive codice
    S->>TUI: comando test / consegna
    TUI->>Runner: esegue grading locale
    Runner->>Runner: prepara sandbox (Docker/container)
    Runner->>Docker: avvia container runner immutabile
    Docker->>Docker: compila / esegue test
    Docker-->>Runner: report JSONL / exit code
    Runner->>Reports: scrive latest.json
    Runner-->>TUI: esito test
    TUI-->>S: mostra risultati

    Dashboard->>Reports: "legge report: stesso filesystem locale, sync remoto in roadmap"
    Dashboard-->>Dashboard: docente vede esito e valuta
